# In-app feedback popups

When showing success, error, warning, or short progress feedback to users in `goldensoft-hr` or Customer App product UI:

## Do

- Use the in-app popup: `FeedbackPopup` (`src/components/hr/feedback-popup.tsx`)
- Pop up centered over the page with backdrop; Thai title + message + ปิด
- Auto-dismiss success/info; keep error/warning until the user closes
- Keep persistent contextual banners (e.g. offline) as inline `Alert` only when they must stay visible while the user works

## Do not

- `window.alert`, `window.confirm`, `window.prompt`
- Browser / OS notification APIs for routine form or action feedback
- Rely only on an inline `Alert` for one-shot success/error after a user action (use the popup)

## Example

```tsx
const [feedback, setFeedback] = useState<FeedbackPopupState>(null);

setFeedback({ kind: "success", message: "บันทึกเรียบร้อยแล้ว" });
setFeedback({ kind: "error", message: "ไม่สามารถบันทึกได้" });

<FeedbackPopup feedback={feedback} onClose={() => setFeedback(null)} />
```
